{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S03略加入了确认对方是否也有同样感受的诉求，但仍然围绕亲密中的幸福与表达顾虑展开，没有明显改变主线。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03删去了想确认对方是否也喜欢这份亲近的念头，亲密中的相互性有所减弱。\",\n    \"S13把重心更多转向对方能否给出不变的承诺，以及即使得到承诺也无法确定未来的顾虑，使主线部分偏向对保证是否可信的焦虑，而不完全是亲密幸福与无法留住它的痛楚本身。\",\n    \"S14强调不后悔这样喜欢过，更多落在对自身选择的接纳上，弱化了对幸福与失去之痛交织状态的回望。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地保留了亲密带来的欢喜、想让它延续的渴望，以及明知无法保证它长久而产生的痛楚，三者在各段中相互牵动。Y虽然也包含这些元素，但后半段更容易转向对承诺和未来可靠性的追问，使具体顾虑部分取代了Center本身。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ac679f67-6ded-4085-a66b-ee23e42b14b5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T094505234523Z", "elapsed_seconds": 13.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:45:19.063323+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f810989163181454bed7b09a4cf77c968ff409e5983f99dc939f39c8ea91e49", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 